# Netlify holds HTML in a durable edge cache (ttl 1y) and can keep serving a
# stale copy after a deploy, so new deploys and Sanity content updates don't
# show up for visitors on an un-invalidated edge. Make the CDN revalidate HTML
# on every request; keep fingerprinted build assets immutable.
/*
  Netlify-CDN-Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/_astro/*
  Netlify-CDN-Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
